   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## QuantFunc Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n- **QuantFunc Qwen-Image-2.1 Loader** replaces the official `Load Diffusion Model` (UNETLoader): the QuantFunc engine runs the 32-block transformer; the text encoder (`CLIPLoader`, type `qwen_image`), `TextEncodeQwenImage21`, the VAE, the sampler and CFG stay stock ComfyUI.\n- `transformer`: the QuantFunc int4 export under `models/diffusion_models`.\n- `quality_enhance`: OFF (default) is faster; the subject and scene stay the same, but details such as poses, faces or small objects can differ. ON gives the highest quality.\n- Output is **RGBA**: `VAE Decode` + `Save Image` keep the alpha channel, so a transparent result saves as a transparent PNG.\n- Official settings: 25 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple (40 steps = the diffusers default, a little sharper).\n\n**Image edit (two references)** — the official example: `<image1>` = the person (sets the output size), `<image2>` = the shirt. Up to 16 references (`image_1` .. `image_16`)."
   ]
  },
